#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Stun Gun"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Wired Reflexes"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Implanted nerve stimulators grant you a +2 bonus to dexterity while this "
"bionic is active, but a -1 penalty when it is not."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Wire-Induced Stiffness"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Improperly installed wires cause a physical stiffness in most of your body, "
"causing increased encumbrance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of bionic "Squeaky Ankles"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"In a cruel twist of fate, a poorly executed CBM surgery has given you a pair "
"of useless bionics which make squeaking noises when you walk."
msgstr ""
"I en grusom skjebnevridning har en dårlig utført CBM-operasjon gitt deg et "
"par unyttige bionikker som lager knirkelyder når du går."

#. ~ Description of bionic "Probability Travel"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Increases your body's wavelength, allowing you to quantum tunnel through "
"walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, "
"but each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Infolink"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Infrared Vision"
msgstr "Infrarødt Syn"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Repair Nanobots"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Inside your body is a fleet of tiny dormant robots.  While activated they "
"will flit about your body, slowly repairing damage stopping bleeding at the "
"cost of extra power and stored calories.  Excessive use of this CBM can "
"depress the immune system.  No power is consumed if there is nothing to heal."
msgstr ""

