"A shallow pool of sewage, leftovers from mankind's heyday now mixed with the "
"festering gore that oozes down the storm drains whenever it rains."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "shallow pool water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
