"scientific ID badge near it if you do not fear the machine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom inside a flask "
"that is universally known to indicate SCIENCE.  The stark red LED blinks "
"askance at your geek cred.  You could swipe a scientific ID badge near it to "
"unlock the gates to discovery."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "Facility entrance card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
