"emblazoned on the matte black surface with an illegible heavy industrial "
"company title.  A red LED blinks on the card reader.  Perhaps an industrial "
"ID card could still open it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"A smartcard reader.  The universal symbol of an eagle driving a tank, biting "
"a grenade pin, stands rampant in front of an American flag.  A small, red "
"LED remains constant, as if watching you, waiting.  You could swipe a "
"military ID card in front of the reader if you dared."
msgstr ""

