#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid ""
"A barrier made of laminated safety glass.  It's a lot tougher than regular "
"glass, and is designed to break into fragments that are nowhere near as "
"sharp."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "smoothed rock"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
