#. ~ Description of "Faraday chainmail"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Jury-rigged armor made by affixing a full-body suit of chainmail over a "
"rubber cleansuit, with copper wire threaded through to create a low "
"impedence route to the ground that doesn't travel through the wearer.  It is "
"hot, heavy, and uncomfortable, and the plastic face shield doesn't help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Leg and body armor crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned "
"biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chitin armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Lightweight leg and body armor made from the exoskeletons of giant "
"arthropods."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "WS-47G moisture retention suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The WebbStar moisture retention suit utilizes advanced technology to prevent "
"up to 30% of moisture loss through perspiration.  The suit is powered by the "
"micro-motions of the body, especially breathing and walking motions.  "
"Because of this, your walking speed is impaired while wearing it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Faraday platemail"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"This full suit of medieval platemail, complete with a chain hood and plastic "
"face shield, has been strapped over some kind of cleansuit and strung with "
"copper wiring."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "WS-47G moisture retention suit"
msgid_plural "WS-47G moisture retention suits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

