"a book that explains the ancient Mithraic religion and its various "
"inscriptions, artifacts, characteristics and rituals.  The book, written by "
"a team of scholars and experts in the field, aims to provide a comprehensive "
"understanding of the Mithraism and its significance in the ancient world."
msgstr ""

