msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hydrogen peroxide"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Dilute hydrogen peroxide, a liquid sold for household cleaning and first "
"aid, though it's not the most effective antiseptic.  It foams a little when "
"in contact with organic matter, but is otherwise harmless."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gummy vitamin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in a fruit-flavored chewy "
"candy form.  An option of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  "
"Excess use can cause hypervitaminosis."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "multivitamin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in pill form.  An option "
"of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  Excess use can cause "
"hypervitaminosis."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ibuprofen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Ibuprofen, a mild NSAID analgesic.  It relieves pain and swelling, but "
"raises blood pressure more than other NSAIDs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rolling tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Loose, fine-cut tobacco leaves.  Popular in Europe and among hipsters.  "
"Highly addictive and hazardous to health.\n"
"Can either be rolled into a cigarette with some rolling papers or smoked "
"through a pipe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift antiseptic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift antiseptic made from ethanol.  It can be used to disinfect wounds, "
"though it's not as effective as the real thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "joint"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a "
"piece of paper and ready for smokin'."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "metaprolol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Metaprolol, a classic beta blocker.  It lowers blood pressure and decouples "
"heart rate from stressful events such as anxiety or pain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chewing tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Mint-flavored chewing tobacco.  While absolutely terrible for your health, "
"it was once a favorite amongst baseball players, cowboys, and other macho "
