msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "naproxen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Naproxen, a slow-acting over-the-counter pain medicaton.  It takes up to an "
"hour to kick in, but lasts longer than other NSAIDs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "caffeine pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
