"This is a relatively small cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings "
"and emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled, extremely compact "
"carbine.  Containing appropriate retool components for a given weapon "
"platform, including adorably small upper receiver assemblies, pistol-length "
"swappable barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents "
"could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
