"A modest offering from the Smith and Wesson (S&W) gun company, this is a "
"medium sized pistol that fires the .22 LR cartridge.  Featuring an "
"integrated rail for optics mounting, it was a popular .22 handgun amongst "
"shooters of the low-power cartridge."
msgstr ""

