#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
msgid ""
"Essentially a slightly scaled up Kel-Tec P-32 in .380 ACP, the ever popular "
"P-3AT offers better ballistics in a small, concealable lightweight package.  "
"Handling leaves something to be desired due to snappier recoil and "
"diminutive controls."
