"A Pietta reproduction of the Civil War era LeMat revolver, a rare and "
"unusual cap & ball .44-caliber revolver.  While its original non-"
"standard .42 or .35 caliber curbed its usefulness for the CSA army, this "
"reproduction is offered in more prevalent .44 caliber.  Despite modern "
"quality materials, the design is still rather delicate."
