#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
#. ~ Description of "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"Formerly belonging to an RMES mech-suit, this powerful long-range laser "
"rifle was never designed for human hands.  You might be able to make it work "
"if you deployed it or mounted it to a vehicle, though, and its long range "
"and potency could be pretty handy if you can keep it powered."
