#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .223 extended-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .223 extended-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible "
"bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis "
"of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions and requiring "
"STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly makes the most from the weapon's "
"bullpup design with a 20-inch barrel configuration, coaxing increased "
"terminal performance from fired rounds."
msgstr ""

