"A large sheet of glass, easily shattered.  Useful for repairing windows."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sheet of tempered glass"
#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid ""
"A large, durable sheet of tempered glass, the kind used in windshields.  "
"This safety glass has the curious property of breaking into small, non-"
"lethal pieces upon shattering."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broken glass"
#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
