#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil "
"lamp.  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to "
"be extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not "
"provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  Use it to light it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
