"spiders in seconds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rubber sealant spray"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An aerosol spray can that contains (if there's any left) quick-drying liquid "
"butyl rubber, which can be sprayed onto fabric and other materials to make "
"them waterproof, or onto surfaces like spraypaint."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "spraypaint"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An aerosol spray can used to store paint under pressure.  Activate it to "
"make graffiti on the floor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "crystal urn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
