msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "smart watch"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A touchscreen watch that comes with many uses, such as a calendar, alarm, "
"and even a fitness app, for when you want to check your health on the go!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "atomic headlamp"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A very dim lamp powered by the magic of nuclear decay.  It's a bit bulkier "
