#. ~ Description of monster "swollen tearjerker"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"A bloated corpse, its ballooning skin blistered and rashy and its face caked "
"in mucus.  The off-color orange gas that occasionally leaks from it makes "
"your eyes water and smells faintly of pepper."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "bombardier boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "A bombardier boomer explodes!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "boomer glutton"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"A large, grotesque ball of flesh and fat.  Seemingly vestigial limbs flop "
"around haphazardly as it rolls across the ground.  You occasionally catch a "
"glimpse of bulging eyes and a distended gaping maw oozing some sort of black "
"sludge."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "gasoline zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"A massively bloated zombie that has either been chugging gasoline or making "
"biofuel in its distended gut; fumes and flames escape from its mouth and "
"liquid petroleum leaks from its waddling form."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief and layered in rolls of fat.  It "
"emits a horrible odor, and a putrid sludge dribbles from its mouth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "sleepwalker zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"A zombie swollen with a bluish, oddly sweet smelling gas.  It stumbles "
"around even more than regular zombies, as if heavily intoxicated."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s spews bile!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "big boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
