msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "boomer glutton"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "The glutton vomits sludge!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "big boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"This zombie has bloated well beyond human size, as though inflated by the "
"putrid goo overflowing from its gullet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bombardier boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's exposed ribcage is encircled by swollen lungs and other "
"organs.  You would prefer to be far away when they burst."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bloated zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"With its gray skin swollen to near-rupture with putrid gas, this cyst-"
"covered zombie looks like it could violently burst under the slightest of "
"disturbances."
msgstr ""

