msgid ""
"I was a cop.  Small town sheriff.  We got orders without even really knowing "
"what they meant.  At some point one of the g-men on the phone told me it was "
"a Chinese attack, something in the water supply… I don't know if I believe "
"it now, but at the time it was the best explanation.  At first it was weird, "
"a few people - <zombies> - fighting like rabid animals.  Then it got worse.  "
"I tried to control things, but it was just me and my deputies against a town "
"in riot.  Then things really got fucked up."
msgstr ""

