msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I honestly don't know.  I wonder if some of the others would have come back "
"to their senses, given time.  I don't think I'm anything special.  Maybe a "
"lot of them did, and just weren't on the edge of the crowd at the time.  "
"I'll tell you, almost as soon as I came back to myself, I could see some of "
"the rioters looking at me like I was prey.  I didn't stick around to see "
"what would happen."
msgstr ""

