msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We got to my buddy's ranch, but the <swear> g-men had been there first.  It "
"was all boarded up and there was a police barricade out front.  One of those "
"<swear> turrets… <swear> shot Buck.  Almost got me too.  I managed to get my "
"pup… get him outta there, that… it wasn't easy, had to use a police car door "
"as a shield, had to kill a cop-zombie first.  And then, well, while I was "
"still cryin', Buck came back.  I had to… <swear!>.  I… I can't say it.  You "
"know."
