msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm> I worked in a lab.  Don't look at me like that, it "
"had nothing to do with this stuff… I was studying protein-protein "
"interactions in smooth muscle in mice, using NMR.  Nothing even vaguely "
"related to zombies.  Anyway, I was at last year's Experimental Biology "
"conference in San Francisco, and an old friend of mine was talking about "
"some really weird shit she'd heard of coming out of government labs.  Really "
"hush hush stuff.  Normally I wouldn't put much cred into that sort of thing, "
"but from her, it actually had me worried.  I packed a bug-out bag just in "
"case."
msgstr ""

