#. ~ A wandering survivor, a pretty tough and capable dude.  Represents an NPC version of a person much like the player.
#. ~ Job description of "Beggar" NPC class
#. ~ All the beggars have been camping inside the evac shelter because they're too weak and unskilled to make it on their own.
