"FROM: Big Science Supply Depot\n"
" TO: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" RE: Kristi, Act Now and Save!\n"
"\n"
" Hi KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" We appreciate you choosing BIG SCIENCE SUPPLY DEPOT for all your laboratory "
"needs!  Based on your purchase history, might we recommend some of the below "
"items?\n"
" Now on sale for 15% off!\n"
"\n"
