#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[SKILLED LIAR] Then you're definitely not Malsumis and everything is cool.  "
"So Malsumis wants to kill everybody right?  I guess they're feeling pretty "
"great right now huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
