"antiseptic and analgesic?  Something like that is likely to be mighty "
"helpful out here.  I want you to head to the nearest swamp, collect 20 "
"cattail stalks, and bring them back here.  In exchange, I'll show you how to "
"harvest the jelly, provided you can demonstrate you have the skills."
msgstr ""

