msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to have better food storage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to have some cans to store food in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to read some mystery novels."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to read some trapping guides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd look anywhere there's food waste or scrap piles.  We can wash out the "
"cans when we get them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd loot libraries and bookstores."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd mean so much to the both of us, and there's a lot of money involved."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd poke around any industrial sites for some."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd try a gardening store or a home supply store would have some."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd wear a hazmat suit while I'm in there.  Those spores are absolutely "
"nasty for your health, if my observations of <zombies> nearby are any "
"indication."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll find someone else, then."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'll have to be careful with this thing, thanks for getting it for me.  "
"Let's see what this can do…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to look for them myself…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to make my own, I guess…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm looking to construct some fortifications around the church, should any "
"of Satan's devils decide to run amok.  We have most of the material needed "
"for such an undertaking, but processing our raw lumber is taking far too "
"long.  I've heard a planer could do such in a fraction of the time; I'll pay "
"for two of them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm not gonna go and fix this <swear> mess."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm running out of antipsychotics, and Arturo is starting to see things "
"again.  I'd pay for seventy-five antipsychotic pills, and be eternally "
"grateful."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm starting to run low on cloth for my sewing.  I think three hundred cloth "
"patches should hold me for a while; I'll pay you for them if you get me some."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm wanting to experiment with some of the more…  otherworldly fauna that "
"have appeared recently.  I saw these pink berries inside a fungal "
"infestation the other day before I burned it with a Molotov.  If you could "
"get me one, I can pay you with a discount on my medicine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm wanting to try growing some new plants.  I've never tried growing "
"cactus; if you could find some seeds for me, I'd pay you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've assembled quite a collection of evidence in my research, and I want an "
"easier way to organize it.  If you could get me one of those e-ink tablets, "
"I could scan all my documents into an easily-preserved digital format.  "
"There's some money for you, too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've been drawing up some plans to expand our food storage around here.  Now "
"that we won't starve to death anytime soon, our old crates just aren't "
"cutting it, so we're going to build a small warehouse to store everything, "
"and I've gathered a crew to build it.  We've got most of the materials "
"covered, but we don't have enough sheet metal to make the shelves.  If you "
"could get us about 5,000 pounds of the stuff, I'll pay you handsomely with "
"what we have.  How does that sound?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've been looking to spruce up this place with some iconography, and a small "
"relic would do just that.  It'd help tremendously with morale around here, "
"so I need you to find one for me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've been writing for a bit, and I've used up my pencils.  If you could get "
"me thirty more, I'll give you some money."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've decided to broaden my horizons with my research, now I need more "
"general documents for examination, get the big picture.  If you could get me "
"two hundred files, on anything, I'll pay you for them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've decided to start making more concentrated remedies for more serious "
"cases, but I don't have a way of refining any herbs to that degree.  I'd pay "
"for a chemistry set."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've got an idea to solve my problem.  I'll pay you if you can find seven "
"oxycodone pills for me; the ones they used to prescribe after a surgery."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've had a craving for fish recently.  Could you find three cans of tuna for "
"me?  I'll pay you for them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've started working on a small project of mine which requires a great deal "
"of computational input.  A piece of MatheMAX software would be a great help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"If I were you, I'd bring a gun and a butcher knife.  I don't think bug spray "
"work anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "If you can find a steel mill, I'd look there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Investigate the Center"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"It feels like I'm doing this for revenge.  I have one last mission for you.  "
"Ever seen those ginormous bee hives?  Well, I can tell you where the closest "
"one is.  Just kill off one stray bee, harvest its stinger and bring it to me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It'd really help me in getting your stuff to you faster."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It'd really help us…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"It's less like a well, and more like a covered pit currently.  I'll need you "
"to find a mechanical pump, one that will make this <swear> thing work."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It's not a big deal, it isn't that urgent."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It's okay, I can do without them.  Just let me know if you reconsider."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Its a simple job."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just bring it to me when you have it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just bring them to me when you have it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Kill some bandits for Helena Misinter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "End The Nightmare"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Kill whatever's keeping Zachary up at night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to find that pump?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to succeed, survivor?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Mathematical Measures"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God protect you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May the Lord bless you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
