msgid "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Righteous judgement shall come!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "See who's over there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since <the_cataclysm> happened, I've had a surprising amount of free time.  "
"I want to start writing, but there's very little paper around here.  For the "
"time being, eight hundred sheets should do; I'll pay if you can get it for "
"me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since we've got all the stuff to store away food, I figure that it's time we "
"get some more.  I've been talking it over with Russell, and I think setting "
"out animal traps is a good way to go.  The problem is, nobody here knows how "
"to do it.  I've heard that The Modern Trapper is a good place to start, so "
"if you could get me a copy, I'd really appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found the books?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found the cans?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Someone's house might have one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes it gets a little bit boring up here, and I like to read something "
"to take my mind off of things.  Problem is, I've run out of books.  I've "
"been wanting to read some mystery novels as of late, so could you get me "
"three of them?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Sorry, I had to find someone else since you didn't come through."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Spinning Wheels"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Store Up Your Grain"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Take care of yourself out there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I can't cut anything with this dull knife."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much!  I'll get back to work on my manuscript, I should have it "
"ready in a month or so."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you so much!  This should last for a while."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, <granny_name_g>.  I'm glad the youngsters still help the elderly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  Take these for your trouble."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  The truth is ever closer!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  This should do me for a while."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, here's your payment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, me and Russell will start studying it soon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, now we won't have to worry about running out of food in the "
"winter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Arturo will be happy to get these."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I don't like killing people, but this time we had too.  Here, "
"take this; its some of our internal money that we've started using.  You "
"know those religious pamphlets shaped like bills people would leave?  These "
"are some of those, couldn't stand 'em myself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I should have some eggs in a week, once I finish the coop.  Come "
"back and buy some!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Maybe you people aren't so bad after all."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  This will keep me busy for a while.  Please take this as a token "
"of my gratitude."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  You're welcome to some of our first batch, if you're interested."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks <name_g>, I'm counting on you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  It'll take a load off my shoulders.  I "
"finally won't have to worry about this problem anymore."
msgstr ""

