#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"The best place to look is probably on rooftops, and remember: we need full "
"arrays, not just the little panels or cells.  One array is made from four "
"panels, got it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "The storage room of a pharmacy should have them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There should be plenty on poster-boards around town.  A police station "
"should have a lot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There's a lot of places to look.  They are common in house kitchens, "
"restaurants or grocery stores."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There's a weird fungus that started to invade ever since <the_cataclysm>, "
"and several individuals in strange robes are cultivating it.  I've seen what "
"it can do, so I need you to execute them and destroy all traces of these "
"strange mushrooms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "They should be near the counter, or on a shelf."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This could give us a prosperous future, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This is wonderful!  I'll really be able to put the pedal to the metal!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This means so much to me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This passion of mine may just be getting to me…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This should be very useful to us.  Now we can truly begin our march of "
"righteousness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This should occupy my work for a while.  Thanks <name_g>, we'll discover the "
"truth one of these days."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This task is bit more serious.  I don't have enough jars to preserve "
"perishables for the future, and we can't just store everything in salt.  We "
"could do our own canning if we had some more glass jars.  I could get by "
"with 5 for now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This'll be quite useful in the future.  Thank you, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"To be honest, I'm not alright.  Have you met Darryl?  He's my husband, and "
"we had a go at getting a baby recently.  The thing is, its not happening.  "
"Now that we're in a safe spot, on our feet again, I want to try.  I'm trying "
"to find some fertility supplements.  I ordered some before <the_cataclysm>, "
"but I never got to pick them up.  If you'd go over and get them for me, I'd "
"pay you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Too trivial for you?"
msgstr ""

