#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Good evening.  Welcome to our safe zone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Gotta earn my keep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Heard anything about a helicopter crash?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Hello.  Welcome to our safe zone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "How did you get saddled with guard duty?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I didn't see it myself but I heard the rumors about it, apparently it "
"crashed somewhere nearby but I haven't seen any smoke or corpse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I don't have a lot of free time for that sort of thing.  Maybe talk to the "
"shopkeep, they know more about scheduling and stuff."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "I dunno, I wasn't there but I overheard some guy talking about it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I'd rather stand around looking threatening than scrub gore out of the tiles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take 'em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take 'em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take 'em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "It's honest work, and now and then I get to take a zombie down."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Keep civil or I'll bring the pain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Ma'am, you really shouldn't be traveling out there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Nah."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "No, sorry…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "None of your business really, is it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Not unless you pay me.  Try the shopkeep, they can sell our services just "
"like anything else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Nothing too fancy.  We have a rota of anyone able bodied that can handle "
"themselves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Oh the helicopter?  Yeah, I tried finding the crash site around where the "
"guy said he heard the crash but I didn't find nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Oh, yes, what a story, I almost wish I had been there to see it, almost."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Sure yeah, I remember, I was on caravan duty when I saw it, it got caught in "
"of those weird storms, as we started driving away I heard a big splash sound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Talk to one of the bosses about that.  You'd have to pay me to go back there "
"though, that's gonna be a hell of a job."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"The crashed helicopter?  Eh, I'm pretty sure it's just a story, no one ever "
"found anything."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Yeah I was part of the caravan that spotted it, it was headed east then when "
"the storm broke out it got caught by some kind of creature, I heard gunshots "
"then it started flying down rapidly, I heard it crash but I'm not sure where "
"exactly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Yes I was told the story by the others, I'm glad I wasn't there though, I "
"hate those storms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"You know how it is, people talk, I mean sure, there was one of those weird "
"storms at the time but the helicopter story?  I don't believe it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Can I trade for supplies?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Download Workstation Data"
