msgstr "Makayla Sanchez"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"Nothing good.  Had a pal on the road with a ham radio, but she's gone like "
"everyone else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
