#. ~ Description of scenario "Abandoned" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Accident or illness left you under intensive care.  When your hospital was "
"overrun, you were considered a lost cause and left behind.  You awaken to "
"the sound of movement around the hospital."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Abandoned" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
