#. ~ Description of scenario "Emergency Shutdown" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were working in a nuclear power plant.  Now "
"you're trapped inside, surrounded by the shambling bodies of what used to be "
"your coworkers.  The reactor's shut down, but you don't know if there's been "
"a radiation leak and you need to get away from here fast before you find out "
"the hard way."
msgstr ""

