"A small, lightweight, bright light that illuminates a narrow cone outside "
"the vehicle when turned on.  During installation, you can choose what "
"direction to point the light, so multiple headlights can illuminate the "
"sides or rear, as well as the front."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "floodlight"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
msgid ""
"A very bright, circular light that illuminates the area outside the vehicle "
"when turned on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "directed floodlight"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
msgid ""
"A very bright, directed light that illuminates a half-circular area outside "
"the vehicle when turned on.  During installation, you can choose what "
"direction to point the light."
msgstr ""

