#. ~ Description of "tiny pistol ammo, ball"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol_tiny.json
msgid ""
"Minuscule pistol and rifle ammunition, for target practice or turn of the "
"century sidearms.  Sold in great quantities preceding the riots.  'Ball' is "
"an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, "
"better reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr ""

