#. ~ Description of profession "Para-Amputee" for female
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost both of your legs.  Since then, you "
"have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a normal life.  Even if society has collapsed, so long as "
"you've got your trusty wheelchair, you'll be alright."
