#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Many of the scientists investigating the immense power of mutation wondered "
"if it could cure limb loss and restore people.  You made the perfect subject "
"with which to test this.  Even though your day to experiment never came, you "
"might have some hope yet of seeing the potential cure to your problems."
