#. ~ Feed message of monster "titanis walleri"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  It clicks its beak a few times and lowers its "
"head, allowing you to pet it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Feed message of monster "saber-toothed cat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It emits a growling purr as you pet it."
