#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
msgid ""
"After you have unlocked them, missions are generated randomly once an "
"expedition begins.  These mostly involve finding and killing targeted "
"enemies, and any remaining missions fail when you return home.  There is no "
"penalty for failing missions, so if they are too far out of the way or too "
"difficult, you can try for better luck in the next expedition.  Completed "
"missions reward warp shards.  Harder missions give more shards!\n"
"\n"
"You can also unlock slaughter missions, which require a total amount of "
"kills in a single expedition.  These can be completed anywhere, but reward a "
"smaller amount of shards."
