"Bloodthirst surges through you like electricity.  The clarity of the world "
"and its natural flow pierces your mind.\n"
"In every future expedition, you will be tasked to find and extinguish living "
"entities that have absorbed warp.  Do this and you will be rewarded."
msgstr ""

