"to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: East Room 3.  Expand the eastern room to very generous "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The eastern room is a nice size, but you're on a floating island.  What if "
"you had a place where you could admire the beautiful view without having to "
"worry about the blowing winds?  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: East Room Gallery.  Add an enclosed gallery to the eastern "
"room to allow viewing off the side of the island."
msgstr ""

