msgid "Skip verification step during loading"
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2782
msgid ""
"If enabled, this skips the JSON verification step during loading.  This may "
"give a faster loading time, but risks JSON errors not being caught until "
"runtime."
msgstr ""

