#~ msgid ""
#~ "Vicious claws have been surgically installed inside your fingers, "
#~ "allowing you to extend and retract them at the cost of a small amount of "
#~ "power.  These do considerable cutting damage, but prevent you from "
#~ "holding anything else while extended."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Onde klør er blitt installert inne i fingrene, slik at du kan utvide og "
#~ "trekke dem inn på bekostning av en liten mengde strøm. Disse gjør "
#~ "betydelig kuttskader, men forhindrer deg i å holde noe annet mens de er "
#~ "forlenget."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Want to loot everything not nailed down in one go?  Use zone manager to "
